# Example .argus rule. Run with:  argus scan --rules examples/rules
id: mcp-unpinned-npx
name: MCP server launched via npx with no version pin
severity: high
target: mcp

match:
  all:
    - field: command
      contains: npx
    - field: args
      not_regex: '@\d+\.\d+\.\d+'

description: >-
  npx resolves and executes the newest matching package at launch, so the code
  reviewed at configuration time is not necessarily the code that runs.
remediation: Pin the package to an exact version, or vendor the server locally.
tags: [mcp, supply-chain]
